service github: ```md
---
description: Use when the agent needs GitHub MCP access.
transport: http
target: https://mcp.github.com/mcp
headers:
  Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_TOKEN
---

Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

service linear: ```md
---
description: Use when the agent needs Linear MCP access.
transport: stdio
target: npx -y mcp-remote https://mcp.linear.app/sse
env:
  LINEAR_API_KEY: $LINEAR_API_KEY
  API_KEY: $NOT_THE_SAME_NAME
---

Use this service when the agent needs Linear access.
```

psyche reviewer: ```md
Prefer concrete findings and direct language.
```

prompt review: ```md
---
params: path, focus?
---

Review {{path}} carefully.
{{focus}}
```
